Proves exact integrals over cells {0 ≤ u₁ ≤ A, 0 ≤ u₂ ≤ B, u₁ + u₂ ≤ D}
(monomials, cap powers, rational polynomials; boxVal computable over ℚ)
with boundary cases, the three branches of Lemma 9.2's endpoint in the
two aggregates, the cap cell of a piece and its closed-form piece
integral via V2e-A's two-aggregate theorem (including r = 0). At Table 3
the τ constraint is inactive on the cap branch (every cap cell is a
rectangle), and a kernel certificate evaluates the cap-branch part of
J_T(1) on the piece ({0}, ∅). Adds Comparator/capcell_v2eb.json,
controls, the result record and the updated V2e roadmap.

